                "text": "Congratulations to @HouseAgGOP Chairman @CongressmanGT on the bipartisan committee passage of the Farm Bill.\n \nI am pleased that the Farm Bill increases reference prices and boosts the affordability of crop insurance to ensure a strong farm safety net. It also builds on Republican work to crack down on the purchase of farmland by China. \n\nFarmers and ranchers feed and clothe our nation; the farm bill is good for all Americans.",
